Package: xtweetsR
Title: Lightpanda Browser Automation for X/Twitter Data Collection
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Agustin Nieto
Maintainer: Agustin Nieto <agusnieto77@gmail.com>
Description: An R package that controls Lightpanda and collects structured
    post data from X/Twitter, with network-first extraction, DOM fallback,
    deduplication, checkpoints, persistence, and reproducible research metadata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    processx
Suggests:
    curl,
    pkgload,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
